{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Ajjuna","html":"<article id='thag1.88'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.88 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.88 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Navamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Nine </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Ajjunattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ajjuna </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Asakkhiṁ vata attānaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I was able to lift myself up </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>uddhātuṁ udakā thalaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>from the water to the shore. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vuyhamāno mahogheva, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>While being swept away by the great flood, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>saccāni paṭivijjhahan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I penetrated the truths. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Ajjuno thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
